### Changelog 1: Bulk Fee Receipt Generation

| Sanity Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **title** (en) | Bulk Fee Receipt Generation |
| **slug** | `bulk-fee-receipt-generation` |
| **versionLabel** | v3.2 |
| **releaseDate** | 2026-05-15 |
| **updateType** | `feature` |
| **modules** | `["finance"]` |
| **seoTitle** | Bulk Fee Receipt Generation — ClassGrid v3.2 |
| **metaDescription** | Generate and download fee receipts for entire classes or divisions in one click. No more individual PDF downloads. |
| **summary** (en) | Finance staff (via `/dept/fees/receipts`) can now select a class, division, or custom student group and generate all fee receipts as a single merged PDF — ready to print or email in bulk. Works alongside the existing Defaulters List and Collection Analytics dashboards. |

**Details content** (rich text):
- **The problem**: Finance teams (Fees Dept dashboard) were generating receipts one student at a time. For a school with 800 students, that's 800 clicks.
- **What's new**: Select a class → click "Generate All" → get a single PDF with all receipts, separated by page breaks.
- **Filters**: Filter by paid/unpaid, date range, fee type (tuition/transport/exam). Integrates with the existing Installment Plans and Scholarship & Waivers configs.
- **Bonus**: Each receipt includes a QR code linking to the online payment verification page.
- **Where in platform**: Fees Dept → Receipts (`/dept/fees/receipts`). Also visible in Org Admin → Fees & Payments.

