| **releaseDate** | 2026-04-28 |
| **updateType** | `feature` |
| **modules** | `["attendance"]` |
| **seoTitle** | Real-Time Parent Attendance Alerts — ClassGrid v3.1 |
| **metaDescription** | Parents now receive instant push notifications and SMS when their child is marked absent. No more end-of-day surprises. |
| **summary** (en) | The moment a teacher marks a student absent, the parent receives an automatic push notification (app) and optional SMS. Configurable per institution — choose instant, hourly digest, or end-of-day summary. |

**Details content**:
- **Before**: Parents found out about absences only when report cards arrived — weeks later.
- **Now**: Instant notification within 10 seconds of the teacher marking attendance.
- **Configuration**: Admins choose notification mode — Instant / Hourly Digest / Daily Summary.
- **Privacy**: Parents only see their own child's attendance, never others.

