## ⚔️ 1 COMPARISON PAGE (`comparisonPage` type in Sanity)

### ClassGrid vs EduManage

> **Note**: "EduManage" is a **fictional generic name** — not a real brand. This lets you make fair, honest comparisons without legal issues.

**Approach**: Compare ClassGrid against a "typical traditional ERP" without naming a specific competitor. The name "EduManage" represents the average product in the market.

| Sanity Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **seoTitle** | ClassGrid vs EduManage — Which Education ERP is Right for You? |
| **metaDescription** | A detailed comparison of ClassGrid and traditional education ERPs. Compare pricing, modules, mobile support, deployment speed, and institutional coverage. |
| **heroHeadline** | ClassGrid vs EduManage |

**Comparison points to cover**:

| Feature | ClassGrid | EduManage (Generic) |
|---------|-----------|-------------------|
| **Deployment** | Cloud-based, ready in 48 hrs | On-premise, 2-4 weeks setup |
| **Modules** | 41+ integrated modules across 11 role-based dashboards | 15-20 modules, some add-on |
| **Mobile App** | Native Android + iOS (Play Store) with bottom nav for students & faculty | Web-only or basic wrapper app |
| **Role-Based Dashboards** | Super Admin, Org Admin, 7 department dashboards, Faculty, Student — each with tailored sidebar & work page | Single admin panel, one view for everyone |
| **Admission Pipeline** | Full CRM: Applied → Verified → Merit → Enrolled with form builder & DTE/CET integration | Basic admission form, no pipeline |
| **Fee Management** | Defaulters list, installment plans, scholarships/waivers, bank reconciliation, bulk receipts | Simple fee collection, no automation |
| **Compliance** | NBA/NAAC score tracker with criteria-wise progress, SARAL/DTE auto-exports | Manual report generation |
| **Library & Hostel** | Dedicated dashboards: book catalog, issue/return, e-books, room allocation, mess menu, complaints | No library or hostel modules |
| **AI Features** | ClassGrid AI for question paper generation, quiz management, analytics | No AI capabilities |
| **Parent Portal** | Real-time attendance alerts, fee status, grades, event notifications | Limited or no parent access |
| **Pricing** | ₹50-100/student/year | ₹150-300/student/year + setup fee |
| **Updates** | Auto-updated, always latest version | Manual updates, version lock-in |
| **Support** | WhatsApp + in-app Platform Feedback (`/platform-feedback`) | Email only, 24-48hr response |

**Body content structure** (write 1500–2000 words):

1. **Introduction** — Why choosing the right education ERP matters
2. **Head-to-head comparison** — Go through each feature with 2-3 sentences explaining why it matters
3. **Who should choose ClassGrid** — Schools/colleges wanting modern cloud-based, mobile-first, affordable
4. **Who might prefer EduManage** — Large universities with existing on-premise infrastructure
5. **Verdict** — Honest conclusion

